instanceMethods.comment:
Returns parameters of solution with the given index.
@param theIndex index of tessellation point.
@param thePoint tessellation point. Mutated in place; read the updated value from this argument after the call.
@param theParameter parameters on PCurve corresponded to the solution.
@returns A result object with fields:
- `returnValue`: True in case of valid result, false elewhere.
- `theParameter`: parameters on PCurve corresponded to the solution.
